<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="Sovereign Edge" pubkey="" timestamp="1789347770" url="https://frenchtoastbig7-ux.github.io/fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Pocket Agent, a private on-device Claude agent for GrapheneOS, published by Sovereign Edge Inc.</description></repo><application id="com.sovereignedge.pocketagent"><id>com.sovereignedge.pocketagent</id><added>2026-09-14</added><lastupdated>2026-09-14</lastupdated><name>Pocket Agent</name><summary>Private on-device Claude agent with memory, skills and automations</summary><desc>Pocket Agent is a personal assistant that runs on your phone and uses Claude as its model. It is built for GrapheneOS and talks to exactly one server: Anthropic's API.

What it can do, with your permission:
* Read and send SMS, look up contacts, read and add calendar events, read the call log and recent notifications
* Read and write files in a private workspace folder
* Search and read the web
* Read the screen and tap, type and scroll in other apps (accessibility service)
* Remember you across chats (MEMORY.md / USER.md), write reusable skills, and search past chats
* Run scheduled automations that report back in a private notification
* Split research into parallel read-only sub-agents

Anything that sends, taps, types or changes data is shown to you for approval first. Scheduled runs are read-only. The API key is encrypted with the Android Keystore. There are no analytics and no Google Play Services.

You need your own Anthropic API key.</desc><license>Apache-2.0</license><categories>AI Chat</categories><category>AI Chat</category><web></web><source>https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-agent</source><tracker>https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-agent/issues</tracker><author>Sovereign Edge Inc.</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>2</marketvercode><antifeatures>NonFreeNet</antifeatures><package><version>0.2.0</version><versioncode>2</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketagent_2.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">56d48eca9d31d62dc61100fe936f4d211076d23058fb25293e49bc13e8045a01</hash><size>26256467</size><sdkver>33</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-09-14</added><sig>0210478b3ee16334d75ed5c7273bf544</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE,INTERNET,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,READ_CALENDAR,READ_CALL_LOG,READ_CONTACTS,READ_SMS,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,RECORD_AUDIO,SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM,SEND_SMS,WRITE_CALENDAR,com.sovereignedge.pocketagent.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package><package><version>0.1.0</version><versioncode>1</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketagent_1.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">5c5f2f3f873c089d1f7a1cb68603f4d5790eeb50e8b9b81cf4954493ae1c07da</hash><size>24583314</size><sdkver>33</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-09-14</added><sig>0210478b3ee16334d75ed5c7273bf544</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE,INTERNET,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,READ_CALENDAR,READ_CALL_LOG,READ_CONTACTS,READ_SMS,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,RECORD_AUDIO,SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM,SEND_SMS,WRITE_CALENDAR,com.sovereignedge.pocketagent.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package></application></fdroid>